 Holy Quran rests open on a wooden rehal before you, pages glowing with ornate Madinah illumination, while a giant panoramic window reveals a slowly rotating planet Earth drifting past. All 604 pages of the true Madinah pagination, rendered in clear Uthmani script. Features: Complete Quran \u2014 all 114 surahs, 6,236 verses, true 604-page Madinah layout; ornate Madinah page design with illuminated borders and surah headers; turn pages naturally \u2014 tap with your controller or pinch with your hand; surah navigator (surahs and juz, jump anywhere); search \u2014 jump to any verse (e.g. 2:255) with quick chips for famous passages; bookmarks \u2014 save your place, resume anytime; breathtaking lounge with Earth view; Arabic-first interface with English option; adjustable page brightness, text size, Earth rotation. Private by design: fully offline, single-player. No accounts, no ads, no analytics, no data collection. Your bookmarks never leave your headset.", "short_description": "Read the Holy Quran in virtual reality: the complete Mushaf Al-Madina in a bright, sunlit majlis lounge with a panoramic window onto planet Earth \u2014 turn pages with your hand or controller."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://muse.ai/s/mushaf-vr-privacy-policy-2-jh6cx0xvgzvxjv", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "USA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://muse.ai/s/personal-website-xzu6bxtxsxrrsjxb", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS